{"url": "https://ioffice.jbnu.ac.kr/ioffice/21400/subview.do", "title": "Welcome to the OIA", "text": "Welcome to the OIA Jeonbuk National University Portal OASIS Main Page Login Office of International Affairs Main Page Login Admissions Announcements Undergraduate English Korean Chinese Graduate English Korean Chinese Dragon Project (Chinese Only) Chinese Korean GKS program About US Welcome to the OIA Staff Directory Global Partnerships Campus Location How to Reach JBNU Incoming Inbound Exchange The Feeling Korea Korean Language Course Outgoing Language Program Exchange Program Report FAQ Life at JBNU Visa Leave of Absence & Returning to School Insurance Scholarships Student Support New Student Adjustment Support Program Life Support Program Academic Support Program Career Support Program Notice Board Notice Sites 메뉴닫기 모바일 메뉴 열기 사이트맵 바로가기 Office of International Affairs Driving Innovation and Collaboration Across Borders as We Shape the Global Leaders of Tomorrow 홈으로 즐겨찾기 즐겨찾는 메뉴 닫기 메뉴추가하기 초기화 공유하기 닫기 페이스북 공유하기 트위터 공유하기 핀터레스트 공유하기 카카오스토리 공유하기 주소 공유하기 인쇄하기 Welcome to the OIA /WEB-INF/jsp/k2web/com/cop/site/layout.jsp ioffice_JW_MS_K2WT001_S Welcome to the Office of International Affairs at JBNU The Office of International Affairs’ mission is to facilitate global exchange at JBNU, including student and faculty mobility, through the establishment of MOUs and MOAs. Jeonbuk National University (JBNU) is committed to creating a globalized campus through the Vision 2020 project, aiming to be ranked among the World Top 100 Universities by improving education and research. In line with our dedication to global engagement, JBNU actively participates in the Glocal University project, which seeks to attract international students and scholars to contribute to Korea's future and to link local schools, businesses, and governments with international partners. Through this initiative, we strive to foster a vibrant, inclusive community where diverse perspectives converge, propelling us towards global excellence. JBNU has partnerships with over 400 academic institutions globally, providing students with diverse study abroad opportunities, including exchange programs. The OIA focuses on offering cultural and educational experiences to cultivate future global leaders and foster international cooperation. To attract and retain excellent foreign students, the OIA provides scholarships and support programs. We are dedicated to enhancing JBNU's global prestige and helping our university to become a leading global campus. Privacy Policy Rejection of Unauthorized Email Collection 페이스북 바로가기 인스타그램 바로가기 유투브 바로가기 Address 567 BAEKJE-DAERO, DEOKJIN-GU, JEONJU-SI, JEONBUK STATE 54896 REPUBLIC OF KOREA Tel +82-63-270-2098 FAX +82-63-270-2099 Copyright (c) Jeonbuk National University. All rights reserved. Sites JEONBUK NATIONAL UNIVERSITY TOP"}
