{"url": "https://ioffice.jbnu.ac.kr/ioffice/22309/subview.do", "title": "New Student Adjustment Support Program", "text": "New Student Adjustment Support Program Jeonbuk National University Portal OASIS Main Page Login Office of International Affairs Main Page Login Admissions Announcements Undergraduate English Korean Chinese Graduate English Korean Chinese Dragon Project (Chinese Only) Chinese Korean GKS program About US Welcome to the OIA Staff Directory Global Partnerships Campus Location How to Reach JBNU Incoming Inbound Exchange The Feeling Korea Korean Language Course Outgoing Language Program Exchange Program Report FAQ Life at JBNU Visa Leave of Absence & Returning to School Insurance Scholarships Student Support New Student Adjustment Support Program Life Support Program Academic Support Program Career Support Program Notice Board Notice Sites 메뉴닫기 모바일 메뉴 열기 사이트맵 바로가기 Office of International Affairs Driving Innovation and Collaboration Across Borders as We Shape the Global Leaders of Tomorrow 홈으로 즐겨찾기 즐겨찾는 메뉴 닫기 메뉴추가하기 초기화 공유하기 닫기 페이스북 공유하기 트위터 공유하기 핀터레스트 공유하기 카카오스토리 공유하기 주소 공유하기 인쇄하기 New Student Adjustment Support Program New Student Adjustment Support Program Life Support Program Academic Support Program Career Support Program /WEB-INF/jsp/k2web/com/cop/site/layout.jsp ioffice_JW_MS_K2WT001_S 신입생 오리엔테이션 Orientation for New Students 매 학기 개강 전 (2월 말 또는 8월 말) 외국인 유학생 신입생 오리엔테이션을 실시하여 수강신청, 비자, 오아시스 사용방법, 기숙사 등 학사 관련 교육 실시 Orientation sessions are held for newly admitted international students before each semester starts (late February or late August) to provide essential academic-related education such as course registration, visa guidance, OASIS usage, dormitory procedures, 외국인 유학생을 위한 가이드북 발행 Guide book for Int'l Student 학교 시설 안내, 성적, 시험, 휴복학 절차, 졸업 조건 등 유학생이 필수로 알아야 하는 학사 관련 정보를 정리하여 국문·영문·중국 3개 국어로 가이드북 발행 A guidebook is published in three languages (Korean, English, and Chinese) , containing essential academic information for international students, including details on campus facilities, grades, exams, leave of absence procedures, graduation requirements, and more. 신입생 학교 생활 적응 지원 상담 Counseling for Adjustment to Campus Life 입학 첫 학기 유학생을 대상으로 설문조사 및 상담 실시, 학교 만족도, 유학생활 적응 여부 등 파악 Surveys and counseling sessions are conducted for international students during their first semester to assess their academic progression, satisfaction with campus life, and adaptation to their studies and living environment. Privacy Policy Rejection of Unauthorized Email Collection 페이스북 바로가기 인스타그램 바로가기 유투브 바로가기 Address 567 BAEKJE-DAERO, DEOKJIN-GU, JEONJU-SI, JEONBUK STATE 54896 REPUBLIC OF KOREA Tel +82-63-270-2098 FAX +82-63-270-2099 Copyright (c) Jeonbuk National University. All rights reserved. Sites JEONBUK NATIONAL UNIVERSITY TOP"}
{"url": "https://ioffice.jbnu.ac.kr/ioffice/22307/subview.do", "title": "Life Support Program", "text": "Life Support Program Jeonbuk National University Portal OASIS Main Page Login Office of International Affairs Main Page Login Admissions Announcements Undergraduate English Korean Chinese Graduate English Korean Chinese Dragon Project (Chinese Only) Chinese Korean GKS program About US Welcome to the OIA Staff Directory Global Partnerships Campus Location How to Reach JBNU Incoming Inbound Exchange The Feeling Korea Korean Language Course Outgoing Language Program Exchange Program Report FAQ Life at JBNU Visa Leave of Absence & Returning to School Insurance Scholarships Student Support New Student Adjustment Support Program Life Support Program Academic Support Program Career Support Program Notice Board Notice Sites 메뉴닫기 모바일 메뉴 열기 사이트맵 바로가기 Office of International Affairs Driving Innovation and Collaboration Across Borders as We Shape the Global Leaders of Tomorrow 홈으로 즐겨찾기 즐겨찾는 메뉴 닫기 메뉴추가하기 초기화 공유하기 닫기 페이스북 공유하기 트위터 공유하기 핀터레스트 공유하기 카카오스토리 공유하기 주소 공유하기 인쇄하기 Life Support Program New Student Adjustment Support Program Life Support Program Academic Support Program Career Support Program /WEB-INF/jsp/k2web/com/cop/site/layout.jsp ioffice_JW_MS_K2WT001_S 외국인 유학생을 위한 비자 업무 대행 Visa Services for International Students 외국인 유학생의 원활한 비자처리를 위해 서류 검토 및 접수 업무 대행 실시 (D-2비자에 한함) * 비자 관련 자세한 내용은 비자 메뉴 에서 확인 가능 << 클릭 Support for smooth visa processing, including document review and submission (limited to D-2 visa holders). * Detailed information about visas can be found in the Vi sa Menu << click JBNU Campus Buddy program 한국인 학생과 외국인 유학생을 2:2 팀으로 매칭하여 1개 학기 동안 언어 및 문화교류 실시 캠퍼스투어, 버디데이 등 다양한 미션을 이수하며 한국인과 외국인 학생들이 친구가 되는 교류 프로그램 Korean and international students are paired in 2:2 teams for one semester to facilitate language and cultural exchange. Activities include campus tours, buddy missions, and more, fostering friendships between Korean and international students. 외국인 유학생 워크숍 Workshops for International Students 외국인 유학생들끼리만 떠나는 즐거운 여행! ( 매 학기 1회 실시) 레크레이션, 다양한 게임, 문화체험을 함께하며 유학생들 간 교류하는 프로그램 A fun and interactive journey for international students (held once per semester). Programs include recreational activities, various games, and cultural experiences to promote interaction among students. 한국 문화 체험 프로그램 Korean Cultural Experience Program 남원 춘향제 등 지역 축제에 방문하여 한국 문화를 체험할 수 있는 기회 제공 유학생 페스티벌, 비빔밥체험, 한복체험 등 한국의 전통 문화와 현대 문화를 체험할 수 있는 다양한 프로그램 수시 운영 Opportunities to visit local festivals in Jeonbuk Province and experience Korean culture. Activities include international student festivals, bibimbap-making, Korean traditional tea ceremonies, and other programs combining traditional and modern cultural experiences. 성폭력예방 및 한국법령이해교육 Sexual Harassment Prevention and Korean Law Education 외국인 유학생이 각종 범죄 및 한국 법령 미숙지로 인한 불이익을 당하지 않도록 성폭력예방 및 한국법령이해교육 상시 시행 * 모든 외국인 유학생은 연 1회 이상 교육을 필수 이수해야 합니다. Mandatory education for all international students at least once to prevent sexual harassment and raise awareness about Korean laws. * All international students must complete this education at least once. 외국인 유학생 학생회 International Student Council 현재 9개국 국가별 유학생회를 운영 중으로, 유학생회의 신입생 환영회, 체육대회, 연말모임 등 다양한 행사 운영 지원 Currently, 9 country-specific international student clubs are active, supporting various activities such as welcoming new students, sports competitions, year-end gatherings, and more. Nepal President ACHARYA SUBAS Vice-President CHAPGAIN KESHAV RAJ Contact l ink2subas@gmail.com Mongolia President BAT JARGAL NANDIN ERDENE Vice-President AMINA Contact nana1024ka@gmail.com Bangladesh President A AZAM ALIF KHANDAKER Vice-President RIVAN MEHRAJ HOSSEN Contact a lifglory97@gmail.com Vietnam President TRAN MANH THANG Vice-President 임성은, NGUYEN THI THANH HUYEN Contact vnjbnu@gmail.com Uzbekistan President JAMOLIDDINOV ABDUVOKHI Vice-President BOHODIROV BAHOVUDDIN ISO UGLI Contact odilmorboyev1998@gmail.com India President PAWAR OMKAR YALLOSA, SRINIVASAN DANYA Vice-President LAKSHIMANASATHSHKUMAR Contact omkar@jbnu.ac.kr China President FAN XIAO NAO Vice-President LIU YIJUN Contact 1 349187523@qq.com Pakistan President IBADULLAH KAHTTANA Vice-President BATOOL KINZA Contact i badullahkahttana@gmail.com Africa President MUWANGUZI DANIEL Vice-President WAIGWA PRICILLA WANJA Contact w anjapricilla03@gmail.com 외국인 유학생 동아리 International Student Club 외국인 유학생으로 자체 구성된 유학생 동아리를 운영하여 유학생들의 자유로운 취미 활동 및 교류 촉진 Student clubs composed of international students are organized to promote free hobby activities and interaction among international students Privacy Policy Rejection of Unauthorized Email Collection 페이스북 바로가기 인스타그램 바로가기 유투브 바로가기 Address 567 BAEKJE-DAERO, DEOKJIN-GU, JEONJU-SI, JEONBUK STATE 54896 REPUBLIC OF KOREA Tel +82-63-270-2098 FAX +82-63-270-2099 Copyright (c) Jeonbuk National University. All rights reserved. Sites JEONBUK NATIONAL UNIVERSITY TOP"}
{"url": "https://ioffice.jbnu.ac.kr/ioffice/22308/subview.do", "title": "Academic Support Program", "text": "Academic Support Program Jeonbuk National University Portal OASIS Main Page Login Office of International Affairs Main Page Login Admissions Announcements Undergraduate English Korean Chinese Graduate English Korean Chinese Dragon Project (Chinese Only) Chinese Korean GKS program About US Welcome to the OIA Staff Directory Global Partnerships Campus Location How to Reach JBNU Incoming Inbound Exchange The Feeling Korea Korean Language Course Outgoing Language Program Exchange Program Report FAQ Life at JBNU Visa Leave of Absence & Returning to School Insurance Scholarships Student Support New Student Adjustment Support Program Life Support Program Academic Support Program Career Support Program Notice Board Notice Sites 메뉴닫기 모바일 메뉴 열기 사이트맵 바로가기 Office of International Affairs Driving Innovation and Collaboration Across Borders as We Shape the Global Leaders of Tomorrow 홈으로 즐겨찾기 즐겨찾는 메뉴 닫기 메뉴추가하기 초기화 공유하기 닫기 페이스북 공유하기 트위터 공유하기 핀터레스트 공유하기 카카오스토리 공유하기 주소 공유하기 인쇄하기 Academic Support Program New Student Adjustment Support Program Life Support Program Academic Support Program Career Support Program /WEB-INF/jsp/k2web/com/cop/site/layout.jsp ioffice_JW_MS_K2WT001_S Study Assistant program 외국인 유학생의 공부를 도와주는 한국인 Study Assistant가 국제협력부에서 상주 하며, 유학생이 방문하면 한국어 학습 및 전공 공부 학습 지원. 한국어 공부, 비자 서류 준비에 어려운 부분이 있다면 언제든 Study Assistant에게 도움 요청 가능 A Korean Study Assistant, dedicated to helping international students with their studies, is stationed at the Office of International affairs. International students can visit to receive support for Korean language learning and major-related academic studies. If they encounter difficulties with Korean language study, visa document preparation, or other challenges, they can request assistance from the Study Assistant at any time. 글로벌스터디그룹 프로그램 Global Study Group 한국인 학생 2명과 외국인 학생 2명을 팀으로 매칭하여, 학기 중 스터디 활동 진행. 함께 공부하며 상호 언어 교환 및 학과 학습 도움. 공부 습관을 길러 학업 성취도 향상 도모 Korean students are paired with international students in teams of two to engage in study activities throughout the semester. The program promotes mutual learning, language exchange, and academic support, helping students develop study habits and improve academic performance. Privacy Policy Rejection of Unauthorized Email Collection 페이스북 바로가기 인스타그램 바로가기 유투브 바로가기 Address 567 BAEKJE-DAERO, DEOKJIN-GU, JEONJU-SI, JEONBUK STATE 54896 REPUBLIC OF KOREA Tel +82-63-270-2098 FAX +82-63-270-2099 Copyright (c) Jeonbuk National University. All rights reserved. Sites JEONBUK NATIONAL UNIVERSITY TOP"}
{"url": "https://ioffice.jbnu.ac.kr/ioffice/30897/subview.do", "title": "Career Support Program", "text": "Career Support Program Jeonbuk National University Portal OASIS Main Page Login Office of International Affairs Main Page Login Admissions Announcements Undergraduate English Korean Chinese Graduate English Korean Chinese Dragon Project (Chinese Only) Chinese Korean GKS program About US Welcome to the OIA Staff Directory Global Partnerships Campus Location How to Reach JBNU Incoming Inbound Exchange The Feeling Korea Korean Language Course Outgoing Language Program Exchange Program Report FAQ Life at JBNU Visa Leave of Absence & Returning to School Insurance Scholarships Student Support New Student Adjustment Support Program Life Support Program Academic Support Program Career Support Program Notice Board Notice Sites 메뉴닫기 모바일 메뉴 열기 사이트맵 바로가기 Office of International Affairs Driving Innovation and Collaboration Across Borders as We Shape the Global Leaders of Tomorrow 홈으로 즐겨찾기 즐겨찾는 메뉴 닫기 메뉴추가하기 초기화 공유하기 닫기 페이스북 공유하기 트위터 공유하기 핀터레스트 공유하기 카카오스토리 공유하기 주소 공유하기 인쇄하기 Career Support Program New Student Adjustment Support Program Life Support Program Academic Support Program Career Support Program /WEB-INF/jsp/k2web/com/cop/site/layout.jsp ioffice_JW_MS_K2WT001_S 취업 역량 강화 프로그램 Career Competency Enhancement Program 외국인 유학생 대상 1:1 자기소개서 첨삭, 면접 클리닉, 채용트랜드 특강, 입사지원서 작성법 등 운영 One-on-one support for international students, including self-introduction writing, mock interviews, employment trends seminars, and guidance on writing job application forms. 학부 재학생 대상 진로 취업 상담 Career Counseling for Senior Students 학부 3~4학년 대상 진로와 취업 계획에 대한 설문 조사 및 상담 실시 * 학부 재학생 대상 진로 취업 상담에 참가하지 않은 경우 졸업이 불가능합니다. Career counseling and surveys are conducted for 3rd and 4thyear students regarding their career plans and employment goals. * Graduation is not possible if senior students do not participate in the career counseling. 외국인 유학생 채용/취업박람회 참가 Participation in Job Fairs for International Students 외국인 유학생을 대상으로 실시하는 채용/취업 박람회 사전 등록 및 참가 지원 Support for international students to register and participate in job fairs specifically designed for international students. Privacy Policy Rejection of Unauthorized Email Collection 페이스북 바로가기 인스타그램 바로가기 유투브 바로가기 Address 567 BAEKJE-DAERO, DEOKJIN-GU, JEONJU-SI, JEONBUK STATE 54896 REPUBLIC OF KOREA Tel +82-63-270-2098 FAX +82-63-270-2099 Copyright (c) Jeonbuk National University. All rights reserved. Sites JEONBUK NATIONAL UNIVERSITY TOP"}
