{"url": "https://ioffice.jbnu.ac.kr/bbs/ioffice/5310/357787/artclView.do", "title": "2025학년도 후기 학부 외국인 특별전형 (1차) 합격자 발표 [Undergraduate] Admission Result for 2025 Fall Semester (1st round)", "text": "K2Web Wizard Created 2025.05.09 Modified 2025.05.09 Writer 국제협력부 Views 790 2025학년도 후기 학부 외국인 특별전형 (1차) 합격자 발표 [Undergraduate] Admission Result for 2025 Fall Semester (1st round) ■ 2025학년도 후기 학부 외국인 특별전형 합격자발표 조회 가능 시간 : 2025. 5. 9.(금) 9:00am 부터 가능 합니다. ▶ 신입학 합격자조회 바로가기 << 클릭 Click https://trs03.uwayapply.com/052XJOBV2RGGFLO000LPN4 ▶ 편입학 합격자조회 바로가기 << 클릭 Click https://trs03.uwayapply.com/052YJOBV2RGGFLNVVUKC54 - 위 사이트에 접속한 후 수험번호와 생년월일 을 입력하여 결과 조회 - 합격자는 위 사이트에서 학번 확인 을 꼭 확인해주시기 바랍니 다. - 합격자는 첨부된 합격자 유의사항을 꼭!! 꼼꼼하게 확인해주시기 바랍니다. - 합격자발표는 5월 9일 ~ 6월 30일까지 조회 가능합니다. 불합격 사유는 공개하지 않습니다. 2025학년도 후기 전북대학교 학부 외국인특별전형에 지원해 주신 모든 분께 감사드립니다. * 문의 Contact : 063-270-4653, admissionu@jbnu.ac.kr ■ Admission results for Undergraduate 2025 Fall semester You can check the result after 9:00am 9th (Fri) , May ▶ C h eck admission results for Freshman << 클릭 Click https://trs03.uwayapply.com/052XJOBV2RGGFLO000LPN4 ▶ Check admission results for Transfer << 클릭 Click https://trs03.uwayapply.com/052YJOBV2RGGFLNVVUKC54 - Visit above website and fill your Application number and birthday(YYMMDD). - If you accepted, please check your student ID in above website and remember - Successful students must check the notice for successful students (attachment) - Announcement of successful applicants can be searched from May 9 to June 30 We won't disclose the reason for failure. Thank you everyone who applied for the JBNU 2025 Fall Admissions. * 문의 : 063-270-4653, admissionu@jbnu.ac.kr Attachments 합격자안내사항.pdf Notice for Successful applicants.pdf 合格者确认事项.pdf"}
{"url": "https://ioffice.jbnu.ac.kr/bbs/ioffice/4303/338891/artclView.do", "title": "2025학년도 전기 학부 외국인특별전형 모집 요강 안내 [Undergraduate] 2025 Spring Admission for International Students", "text": "K2Web Wizard 작성일 2024.09.02 수정일 2024.09.02 작성자 국제협력부 조회수 4278 2025학년도 전기 학부 외국인특별전형 모집 요강 안내 [Undergraduate] 2025 Spring Admission for International Students This is JBNU International Affairs. We announce the undergraduate international student admission for 2025 Spring semester. Please see the attached admission guide for details of the admission procedures. ■ Online Application site : https:// www.uwayapply.com/ - You can use the website on application period only. - Visit http://uwayapply.com - Click Int'l Student - Click (Jeonbuk National University - Undergraduate) ■ Self-introduction and study plan are not required. ■ Document Submission (Complete the online application first) - By post or in-person - Address : office of International Affaris, JBNU International Center 3rd floor, Jeonbuk National University, 567 Baekje-daero, Deokjin-gu, Jeonju-si, Jeollabuk-do, 54896 Republic of Korea - Address in Korean : 전라북도 전주시 덕진구 백제대로 567 전북대학교 JBNU인터내셔널센터 3층 국제협력부 (54896) * if you come to JBNU, please visit our office at JBNU International Center 3F ■ Contact - Office of International Affairs, +82-63-270-4653, admissionu@jbnu.ac.kr ■ Schedule 1 st Round 2 nd Round Remarks Application Period 2024. 9. 23.(Mon) 9:00 ∼ 2024. 10. 4.(Fri) 17:00 2024. 11. 6.(Wed) 9:00 ∼ 2024. 11. 20.(Wed) 17:00 - Online Application (Application fee : 80,000KRW) - It is required to submit an application form and other documents after online registration. Required Documents Submission 2024. 10. 11.(Fri) 2024. 11. 27.(Wed) - Submit it by post or visit (3rd Floor of International Center) - Applicants who don’t submit documents by the deadline will not be interviewed and will be rejected. If it is not possible to arrive on the deadline, submit copies of the documents via email by the deadline and submit the original ones later (admissionu@jbnu.ac.kr) - Original documents submission deadline : Feb. 21.(Fri) 2025 Notice of Interview Schedule 2024. 10. 24.(Thu) 2024. 12. 6.(Fri) - Announcement will be posted on JBNU webpage and through applicant’s email. Interview 2024. 10. 29.(Tue) ∼ 2024. 10. 30.(Wed) 2024. 12. 12.(Thur) ∼ 2024. 12. 13.(Fri) - Interview will be conducted by each department. • Students in Korea : In-person interview basis • Students in Overseas : Phone/Video interview - Applicant will be disqualified if they miss the interview - Performance tests(Music, Korean Music, etc) may be required for applicants to the College of Arts. Announcement of Successful Applicants 2024. 11. 15.(Fri) 2024. 12. 31.(Tue) - Announcement will be posted on JBNU webpage and through applicant’s email. Bank Statement Submission Check the Remarks → - Successful Applicants Only Amount: Over 16,000,000KRW (Approx 13,000USD) - Students who stay in Korea : Only the applicant’s own Korean bank account Issued within 30days before visa application. * In the case of D4 → D2 Over 8,000,000KRW - Students who stay in overseas : Applicant’s or Parents’ bank account is available (Foreign bank is also okay) and it should be submitted by 24 th Jan 2025. Diploma/Apostille/ Additional Language Certificate Submission By 2025. 2. 21.(Fri) - Only for those who don’t submit the documents below ⦁ Degree-related documents for prospective graduates ⦁ Certificate of Completion of JBNU Language School ⦁ The final language score of the person who submitted the test receipt - If other documents have not been submitted by deadline, they will be rejected. Issuance of Admission Letter To be announced - The admission letter is only issued after tuition fee payment and all required document submission including provisional graduate students. Tuition payment schedule To be announced - Payment schedule will be announced later (Jan 2025) - Make tuition payment at the designated banks Semester Begins 2025. 3. 3.(Mon) - Spring semester, 2025 begins Please log in 첨부파일 2025 전기 학부 외국인특별전형 모집요강.pdf 2025 Spring Semester Admission Guideline.pdf (CN) 2025 전기 학부 외국인특별전형 모집요강.pdf [서식 1] 번역자확인서.docx [서식 2] 학교 정보 확인서 _校信息___.docx"}
